      Q. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفَيْلَقَ</span></b> , said of a boy, <i>He became big,</i>
or <i>bulky, and fat,</i> or <i>plump;</i> (O, K, TA;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفلّق</span></b> ; both mentioned in the “ Nawádir. ”
(TA.) ― 
